UID:d898db81c57113db756836f8d7f706a4ca79afd8@lewagon-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260925T204801Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Potato Head Presents Dekmantel
LOCATION:Potato Head Beach Club
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, 26 September 2026 \, Potato Head Presents Dekmant
 el transforms Potato Head Beach Club into a full-day and late-night celebr
 ation of electronic music by the Indian Ocean. Running from 2 PM until 4 A
 M at Potato Head Beach Club \, the event brings together an international 
 and Indonesian lineup spanning techno\, house and leftfield electronica. H
 eadlining the programme are Avalon Emerson (US)\, Dekmantel Soundsystem (N
 L)\, Fafi Abdel Nour (NL)\, Ogazón (DE)\, and Soichi Terada LIVE (JP) \, 
 joined by live performances from Danny Satria LIVE and sets from Archie\, 
 Bagvs\, Dita\, Kaazi (AU)\, Kiwed and Sattle. Music remains at the centre\
 , but the collaboration also extends into conversation and cultural exchan
 ge. Throughout the day and night\, guests can take part in a listening ses
 sion\, live Q&As and a Desa Dialogue \, creating opportunities to explore 
 the ideas\, influences and creative practices surrounding electronic music
 . The additional programming reflects the shared ethos of Dekmantel and Po
 tato Head: that music can be a starting point for broader conversations ab
 out culture\, creativity and community.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.
 co.id/upcoming-events/potato-head-presents-dekmantel/\n\nPlease verify wit
 h the organizer before attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/potato-head-presents-dekmante
 l/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8c3a3096846c88fecf6b3f1a22781401a57420d9@lewagon-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260925T204801Z
SEQUENCE:1
SUMMARY:POTATO HEAD PRESENTS DEKMANTEL
LOCATION:Potato Head Beach Club\, Petitenget St No.51B\, Seminyak
DESCRIPTION:This September\, Amsterdam's beloved Dekmantel reunites with Po
 tato Head for another sunkissed celebration of electronic dance music\, co
 mmunity and life by the beach during Bali's perfect month. Respected globa
 lly as a stronghold of full-spectrum techno\, house\, and leftfield electr
 onica\, Dekmantel has spent more than a decade cultivating one of the worl
 d's most adventurous festival communities. On Saturday\, 26 September\, th
 at restless spirit touches down in Bali with an immaculately curated progr
 amme of DJs and live acts from across Europe\, the US\, Japan and Indonesi
 a sharing sounds from sundown until late. This year's lineup features Aval
 on Emerson (US)\, Dekmantel Soundsystem (NL)\, Fafi Abdel Nour (NL)\, Ogaz
 ón (DE)\, Soichi Terada LIVE (JP)\, Danny Satria LIVE\, alongside Archie\
 , Bagvs\, Dita\, Kaazi (AU)\, Kiwed\, and Sattle. Beyond the dancefloor\, 
 Dekmantel Bali offers an immersive cultural experience. Throughout the day
  and night\, attendees can dig deeper by attending a listening session\, l
 ive Q&As\, and a Desa Dialogue for a free-flowing exchange of ideas\, cult
 ure\, and creativity. As the sun sets over the Indian Ocean\, expect world
 -class music\, connection\, and an atmosphere born from Dekmantel and Pota
 to Head's shared values. From the afternoon until late\, we reunite to mak
 e more precious memories on Bali's shoreline. Tickets: https://seminyak.po
 tatohead.co/experience/potato-head-presents-dekmantel-2026?utm_source=theb
 aliguideline&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=dekmantel-september-2026&utm
 _term=bali-event&utm_content=experience-referral-september-2026\n\nMore in
 fo: https://baligasm.com/event/potato-head-dekmantel-sep-2026\n\nPlease ve
 rify with the organizer before attending.
URL:https://baligasm.com/event/potato-head-dekmantel-sep-2026
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART:20260925T220000Z
DTEND:20260925T230000Z
END:VEVENT
